# Line endings, pinned.
#
# Everything in this repository is already stored as LF. This file keeps it
# that way regardless of a contributor's `core.autocrlf`, because
# tools/sync_plugins.py --check compares a skill against its plugin copy
# byte-for-byte (filecmp, shallow=False). Both copies always live in the same
# checkout, so today they match either way — but a contributor who commits
# CRLF for one of them and LF for the other would break that check, and the
# failure would read as content drift when it is only line endings.
* text=auto
*.py   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf
